        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Section 8. Employees who use both continuing education and tuition reimbursement benefits in the same contract year shall be subject to a combined use limitation of $2,000 per contract year. However, the amounts used for continuing education shall not exceed the amounts set forth in Section 3 of this Article.",
